  "cover_text": "John Cohen will be the producer of Rovios self financed poetry project, forthcoming FUEL Plus edition on BBC One today from 10.30pm on Monday 5th May. Following on from Ruth Miller’s IT equivalent/comedy for the All Stars on 4th May at North Bridge Hotel, lunch will suit anyone who wants to contribute - or see a free presentation by the author. The poetry will focus on four questions each about the transformational artforms of poetry, fiction, sculpture, and architecture. Given",
